# 🎯 Hangman Game (Python)

A terminal-based **Hangman Game** built with Python. The player tries to guess a hidden word one letter at a time before running out of lives. The game features ASCII art for visual feedback and a separate word list for better code organization.

## 📌 Features

* 🎮 Interactive command-line gameplay
* 🔤 Random word selection
* ❤️ Limited lives system
* 🎨 ASCII art that updates after each incorrect guess
* 🧩 Modular project structure for clean and maintainable code

## 📂 Project Structure

```
hangman/
│── hangman.py          # Main game logic
│── hangman_words.py    # Collection of words used in the game
│── hangman_art.py      # ASCII art and game visuals
```

### File Description

**`hangman.py`**

* Controls the main game loop
* Handles user input
* Checks guessed letters
* Updates the display
* Determines win or loss

**`hangman_words.py`**

* Stores a list of words used for the game
* Supplies a random word for each new round

**`hangman_art.py`**

* Contains the Hangman ASCII art
* Displays the game logo
* Shows the hangman stages based on remaining lives

